flowchart TB
    UI[Officer clicks Send email] --> API[Backend command]
    API --> AUTH[Authorize officer, application scope, and step 3]
    AUTH -->|denied| STOP[No side effect]
    AUTH -->|allowed| OUTBOX[Write email_requested event]
    OUTBOX --> WORKER[Email worker]
    WORKER --> IDEMP[Idempotency check]
    IDEMP --> PROVIDER[Mail provider]
    PROVIDER --> STATUS[Delivery status]
    API --> AUDIT[Audit actor, application, step, action]
    STATUS --> AUDIT
    WORKER --> RETRY[Bounded retry]
    RETRY --> IDEMP
